# 🍽️ Zomato Analytics Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes Zomato restaurant data using SQL, Excel, Tableau, and Power BI to uncover business insights related to restaurant performance, customer ratings, pricing, online delivery, and cuisine trends.

The project demonstrates the complete analytics workflow including:
- Data cleaning
- SQL analysis
- Dashboard creation
- KPI analysis
- Business storytelling

